  "description": "\\*\\*Original Webtoon:\\*\\* \\[Daum\\](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B0%94%EB%8B%A4%EC%9D%98-%EA%B7%B8%EB%A6%BC%EC%9E%90/2560), \\[KakaoPage\\](https://page.kakao.com/content/60746434) \\*\\*Official Translations:\\*\\* \\[S.Chinese\\](https://pdt.tencentac.com/?adtag=appshare.ios.detail%26QQ%26309&contentId=309&platform=IA) Sun, a rookie film director, and Farah, an employee at a film investment company, are in love with each other. Sun's first film debut was Sun's ex-lover. This is a movie about first love, 'the sea'. Actor Yuna, who plays the role of the sea and is the main character, resembles the sea to a surprising extent, and Sun keeps seeing his first love, the sea, through Yuna. To make matters worse, actor Lee Han-eun, who plays the male protagonist, the persona of Sun, Notorious for his schedule punk, he is the youngest son of the CEO of an investment company. Parra sets foot on the set of a movie as Lee Han's supervisor. You have to watch the scene where Sun shoots a movie about her first love. A line that shoots a movie about an old love, His current lover, Farah, has to look at it. Yuna, who resembles her first love so much Lee Han has feelings for Phara who takes care of him. Can the four of them really be linked only through business relationships? 'Pandora's box' of the past once opened It brings four people to the same stage called .",
